			<div class="col-md-8 order-first">
				<p>
					Jenny wheelbarrow air compressors come in both electric and gas models. Their electric compressors
					are great for motor shops and other areas who need portable air and have electrical power available, yet need to
					avoid the gas fumes of an enclosed area. Jenny gas models are ideal for use around the jobsite and on the go,
					especially where a power supply is not available.
				</p>
				<p>
					These compressors can handle a variety of attachments, from air tools to blow guns. There are a vast array of
					Jenny compressors available. Give us a call at 1-866-203-2944 if you need help in selecting the compressor that is
					best for your operation.
				</p>
			</div>
