							<li>Heavy-duty cast iron compressor pump Made in the USA</li>
							<li>Splash Lubricated</li>
							<li>Directional air shroud for lower temperature</li>
							<li>Pressure relief safety valve</li>
							<li>Stainless steel braided discharge hose</li>
							<li>Directional air shroud for reduced pump temperatures</li>
