						<h4>Jenny 5.5 Horse Power 8 Gallon Gas Compressor- K5HGA-8P</h4>
						<p>
							This 5 horse power Jenny compressor is a great entry level gas compressor. Lighter than the G8HGA-8P, it is
							easy to load in and out of trucks, and moving around the jobsite is done in a breeze. One benefit to the Jenny
							gas compressors is that it comes with an industry proven Honda engine, so you are assured quality. This
							wheelbarrow compressor will produce 8.9 CFM at 100PSI, which delivers plenty of air to get your job done fast and
							efficiently.
						</p>
